X *		Q1 =  0.19480966070088973051623e2
X *		Q2 =  -0.89111090279378312337e1
X *		Q3 =  1.0000
X *
X *		(coefficients from HART table #2705 pg 229)
X *
X *	  (7)	Finally, compute log(x) from:
X *
X *		log(x) = (k * log(2)) - log(sqrt(2)) + log(s)
X *
X */
X
