X *	 WORD N+1 =>	XMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM
X *
X *	For the PDP-11 and the mc68000 the double precision word
X *	format is:
X *
X *	 WORD N =>	SEEEEEEEEMMMMMMM
X *	 WORD N+1 =>	MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM
